---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import Cta from '../components/ui/Cta.astro';
import ServiceStats from '../components/ServiceStats.astro';
import ServiceCases from '../components/ServiceCases.astro';

// Sincronización Headless con WordPress Rank Math
const wpEndpoint = 'https://darkblue-flamingo-706734.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2/pages?slug=meta-ads';
let rankMathSEO = null;

try {
  const res = await fetch(wpEndpoint);
  if (res.ok) {
    const pages = await res.json();
    if (pages && pages.length > 0) {
      rankMathSEO = pages[0].rank_math_head || null;
    }
  }
} catch (e) {
  console.error("Error fetching SEO:", e);
}
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Publicidad Rentable (Meta & Google Ads) | Croilab"
  description="Tus campañas no necesitan más presupuesto, necesitan estrategia. Sistemas de adquisición para escalar tu ROAS y bajar tu CPA."
  rankMathSEO={rankMathSEO}
>
  <!-- 1. HERO HOOK -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[90vh] flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#050505]">
    <!-- Imagen de fondo con textura y degradado vertical -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop" 
        alt="Meta Ads Analytics" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top opacity-30 grayscale mix-blend-luminosity"
      />
      <!-- Degradado vertical: Oscuro abajo (100%), Transparente arriba (0%) -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/80 to-transparent"></div>
      
      <!-- Grid Arquitectónico superpuesto -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:100px_100px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_60%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)]"></div>
      
      <!-- Ruido (Grain) para textura premium -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.25] mix-blend-overlay" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.85%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Luces de fondo dinámicas (Azul Meta) -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-blue-600/15 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-cyan-400/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>

    <Container class="relative z-10 pt-40 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] gap-16 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        
        <!-- Izquierda: Textos -->
        <div class="flex flex-col text-left">
          <h1 class="gsap-title max-w-5xl text-[clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7.5rem)] font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight text-white mb-8" data-custom-speed="0.8">
            Tus campañas no necesitan más presupuesto. Necesitan <br/><span class="italic font-serif font-light text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 via-white/80 to-white/30">estrategia.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="max-w-xl text-[17px] md:text-[19px] leading-relaxed text-white/50 mb-12">
            Dejemos de comprar clics vacíos. Construimos sistemas de adquisición rentables que convierten tráfico frío en facturación predecible. Menos excusas, más ROAS.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-5">
            <a href="#metodologia" class="group relative flex items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-black transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] w-full sm:w-auto">
              Descubrir sistema
              <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-y-1">↓</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/contacto" class="group flex items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/40 w-full sm:w-auto">
              Quiero trabajar así
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Derecha: Mockup Animado Meta Ads -->
        <div class="relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-[4/4.5] flex items-center justify-center perspective-1000 mt-10 lg:mt-0">
           
           <!-- Glow de fondo cinemático -->
           <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600/30 via-indigo-600/20 to-cyan-500/10 rounded-[100px] blur-[100px] animate-pulse-slow mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none"></div>
           
           <!-- Interfaz Ads Manager -->
           <div class="relative w-full max-w-[480px] rounded-[24px] bg-[#0c0c0e]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-[0_40px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden animate-float">
             
             <!-- Header Mac OS style -->
             <div class="h-14 bg-white/[0.03] border-b border-white/5 flex items-center px-6 gap-3">
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                  <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
                  <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
                  <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="ml-4 h-7 flex-1 max-w-[200px] bg-black/40 rounded-md px-3 flex items-center border border-white/5">
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-white/50 font-medium">Ads Manager Pro</span>
                </div>
             </div>
             
             <!-- Contenido del Dashboard -->
             <div class="p-6 relative min-h-[420px] bg-[#050505]">
               
               <!-- Top Stats Row -->
               <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
                 <!-- Stat 1: ROAS -->
                 <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-colors relative overflow-hidden group">
                   <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-500/10 to-transparent -translate-x-full group-hover:animate-[shimmer_1.5s_infinite]"></div>
                   <div class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-white/40 mb-1">ROAS Total</div>
                   <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
                     <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">4.8x</div>
                     <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-green-400 mb-1">+24%</div>
                   </div>
                 </div>
                 
                 <!-- Stat 2: Ventas -->
                 <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
                   <div class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-white/40 mb-1">Leads Calificados</div>
                   <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
                     <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">342</div>
                     <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-green-400 mb-1">+12%</div>
                   </div>
                 </div>
               </div>
               
               <!-- Gráfica Principal -->
               <div class="mb-6 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-blue-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 to-transparent relative shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.1)]">
                 <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                   <h3 class="text-[12px] font-bold text-white/80">Tendencia de Adquisición</h3>
                   <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase border border-blue-500/20">30 Días</span>
                 </div>
                 
                 <!-- SVG Graph -->
                 <div class="h-[100px] w-full relative">
                   <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 100 40" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="overflow-visible">
                     <defs>
                       <linearGradient id="metaGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                         <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3b82f6" stop-opacity="0.2" />
                         <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#3b82f6" stop-opacity="1" />
                       </linearGradient>
                       <linearGradient id="metaFill" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
                         <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3b82f6" stop-opacity="0.3" />
                         <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#3b82f6" stop-opacity="0" />
                       </linearGradient>
                     </defs>
                     <path d="M0,35 Q15,30 25,25 T50,15 T75,20 T100,5" fill="none" stroke="url(#metaGrad)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="animate-[dash_3s_ease-out_forwards]" stroke-dasharray="150" stroke-dashoffset="150" />
                     <path d="M0,35 Q15,30 25,25 T50,15 T75,20 T100,5 L100,40 L0,40 Z" fill="url(#metaFill)" opacity="0.8" />
                   </svg>
                 </div>
               </div>

               <!-- Lista de Campañas (Skeleton) -->
               <div class="space-y-3">
                 <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
                   <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                     <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(34,197,94,0.6)] animate-pulse"></div>
                     <div class="w-32 h-3 bg-white/20 rounded"></div>
                   </div>
                   <div class="w-12 h-3 bg-white/10 rounded"></div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 opacity-50">
                   <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                     <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
                     <div class="w-24 h-3 bg-white/20 rounded"></div>
                   </div>
                   <div class="w-12 h-3 bg-white/10 rounded"></div>
                 </div>
               </div>

             </div>
             
             <!-- Fade out inferior -->
             <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0c0c0e] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
           </div>

           <!-- Card Flotante 1: Coste por Lead Bajando -->
           <div class="absolute -right-4 lg:-right-10 top-1/4 bg-[#111115]/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] animate-float-delayed z-20">
             <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
               <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                 <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-green-400"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><polyline points="19 12 12 19 5 12"/></svg>
               </div>
               <div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50">CPA (Costo Adq.)</div>
             </div>
             <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
               <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">$14.50</div>
               <div class="text-[12px] text-green-400 font-medium mb-1">-42% vs Mes Ant.</div>
             </div>
           </div>
           
           <!-- Card Flotante 2: Creative A/B Test -->
           <div class="absolute -left-6 lg:-left-12 bottom-1/3 bg-[#111115]/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] animate-float z-20 hidden sm:block" style="animation-delay: 1.5s;">
             <div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50 mb-3">Creative Winner</div>
             <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
               <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-white/10 overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
                 <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=100&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-80" alt="Ad Creative">
               </div>
               <div>
                 <div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white mb-1">Video Story Ads</div>
                 <div class="text-[11px] text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded inline-block border border-blue-500/20">CTR: 4.8%</div>
               </div>
             </div>
           </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <ServiceStats />

  <!-- 1.5 LOS SÍNTOMAS -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#f8f9fa] py-32 overflow-hidden border-t border-black/5">
    
    <!-- Background Grid & Noise for Premium Feel -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:64px_64px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_80%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    
    <Container class="relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 text-red-600 mb-8">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Diagnóstico Crítico</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="gsap-title text-[clamp(2.5rem,4vw,3.5rem)] font-bold tracking-tight text-black mb-6 leading-[1.1]">
          ¿Tu presupuesto se está evaporando sin retorno?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[17px] text-black/50 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          La mayoría de las cuentas publicitarias están configuradas para gastar, no para retornar. Si te identificas con uno de estos escenarios, estás perdiendo dinero.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white p-10 rounded-[32px] border border-black/[0.04] shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/5 to-transparent rounded-bl-[64px] pointer-events-none transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"></div>
          
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-black/10 group-hover:bg-red-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-500 text-black">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-black mb-4 leading-tight">CPA por las nubes</h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/60 mb-8">Zuckerberg y Google se están quedando todo tu margen. Cada mes cuesta más adquirir un cliente y la rentabilidad baja irremediablemente.</p>
          
          <!-- Mini UI Graphic -->
          <div class="w-full h-16 bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/5 rounded-xl flex items-end gap-1.5 p-3">
             <div class="w-full bg-black/10 rounded-t-sm h-[30%]"></div>
             <div class="w-full bg-black/10 rounded-t-sm h-[50%]"></div>
             <div class="w-full bg-red-400 rounded-t-sm h-[75%]"></div>
             <div class="w-full bg-red-500 rounded-t-sm h-[100%] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(239,68,68,0.3)]"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white p-10 rounded-[32px] border border-black/[0.04] shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/5 to-transparent rounded-bl-[64px] pointer-events-none transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"></div>
          
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-black/10 group-hover:bg-orange-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-500 text-black">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="18" y1="8" x2="23" y2="13"/><line x1="23" y1="8" x2="18" y2="13"/></svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-black mb-4 leading-tight">Leads 'Basura'</h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/60 mb-8">Tus anuncios generan muchos clics, pero atraen a curiosos que no tienen el presupuesto o la intención real de comprar.</p>
          
          <!-- Mini UI Graphic -->
          <div class="w-full h-16 bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between p-3">
             <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
               <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/5 flex items-center justify-center"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-black/30"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg></div>
               <div>
                 <div class="w-12 h-2 bg-black/10 rounded mb-1.5"></div>
                 <div class="w-8 h-1.5 bg-black/5 rounded"></div>
               </div>
             </div>
             <div class="px-2 py-1 bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 text-[9px] font-bold rounded">Rechazado</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white p-10 rounded-[32px] border border-black/[0.04] shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/5 to-transparent rounded-bl-[64px] pointer-events-none transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"></div>
          
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-black/5 flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-black/10 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-500 text-black">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 18 13.5 8.5 8.5 13.5 1 6"/><polyline points="17 18 23 18 23 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold text-black mb-4 leading-tight">Caída al Escalar</h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-black/60 mb-8">Tus campañas venden bien con bajo presupuesto, pero en cuanto intentas meterles más dinero para crecer, el ROAS se desploma.</p>
          
          <!-- Mini UI Graphic -->
          <div class="w-full h-16 bg-black/[0.02] border border-black/5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center p-3 relative overflow-hidden">
             <!-- Line Chart SVG -->
             <svg class="w-full h-full text-black/20" viewBox="0 0 100 30" preserveAspectRatio="none">
               <path d="M0,30 L20,20 L40,15 L60,25 L80,28 L100,29" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
             </svg>
             <div class="absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 px-2 py-1 bg-black/80 text-white text-[9px] font-bold rounded border border-white/10">ROAS < 1.0</div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. LA AGITACIÓN -->
  <section class="relative bg-white py-32 lg:py-48 border-t border-black/5 overflow-hidden">
    
    <!-- Decoración de fondo suave -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 right-0 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/50 to-transparent rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <Container class="relative z-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center">
        
        <!-- Izquierda: Copy -->
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-black/5 border border-black/10 text-black/60 mb-8 w-fit">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Enfoque a Resultados</span>
          </div>
          
          <h2 class="gsap-title text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] font-bold tracking-tight text-black mb-8 leading-[1.05]" data-custom-speed="0.9">
            Los 'likes' no pagan <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500">nóminas.</span>
          </h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-6 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-black/60">
            <p>
              Las agencias tradicionales te venden reportes hermosos llenos de "impresiones", "alcance" y <strong class="text-black font-semibold">métricas de vanidad</strong> para justificar su iguala mensual mientras tu margen desaparece.
            </p>
            <p>
              Nosotros somos Media Buyers de respuesta directa. Nuestro único KPI es cuánto dinero entra en tu caja al final del mes. Combinamos compra de medios inteligente con optimización de landing pages para asegurar que <strong class="text-black font-semibold">cada clic sea rentable</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-black tracking-tight">92%</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-black/50 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">De campañas fracasan por<br/>creatividades débiles</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-px h-12 bg-black/10"></div>
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-black tracking-tight">ROAS</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-black/50 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Nuestra única métrica<br/>de éxito a medir</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Derecha: Comparación Visual (Vanity vs Real) -->
        <div class="relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-square flex items-center justify-center perspective-1000">
           
